<view wx:if="{{visible}}" class="privacy-mask">
  <view class="privacy-sheet">
    <view class="eyebrow">你的选择，由你决定</view>
    <view class="section-title">使用照片与语音前</view>
    <view class="muted">照片仅用于识别课本文字或核对答案；录音仅用于转写你的提问。选择的内容会发送到服务端及对应 AI 服务。</view>
    <view class="privacy-link" bindtap="openContract">阅读《用户隐私保护指引》</view>
    <button id="privacy-agree" class="primary" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agreePrivacy">同意并继续</button>
    <button class="plain" bindtap="rejectPrivacy">暂不同意</button>
  </view>
</view>
